  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "Combine beef, onion, garlic, worcestershire sauce, and beef broth in a bowl. Mix well.",
    "In a separate bowl, combine flour, salt, and egg. Mix until dough forms.",
    "Divide dough into 8-10 equal pieces.",
    "Roll out each piece into a thin circle.",
    "Place about 1 tablespoon of the beef mixture in the center of each circle.",
    "Fold the dough over the filling and press edges together to seal.",
    "Brush tops with egg wash and bake for 20-25 minutes or until golden brown."
